|errata_history=The Holotable repository first records this image on 2018-07-08. This full face was imported with the existing PC repository image set; a different full gallery rendering is captured in December 2007. The image prints the errata mark E. Its wording includes movement to a system or sector and immunity to your Alter. The partial in the June 2017 document precedes this repository record; the distinct round-disc full image is captured in December 2007. Before (June 2017 partial): [[File:Dagobah-D-Flagship-June-2017-partial.png|frameless|300px]]; after (2018 full face): [[File:Dagobah-D-Flagship-PC-E1-2018-07-08.gif|frameless|300px]]. Game-text words are unchanged. This is image 3 in the documented sequence, while the face prints <code>E</code>. The article follows image order and preserves the printed mark.
